a) In respect of projects for purchasing commercial housing to lease to entities of central authorities other than entities of people’s armed forces, the Ministry of Construction shall request the Prime Minister to make investment decision or the Minister of Construction to make investment decision if they are authorized by the Prime Minister;
b) In respect of projects for purchasing commercial housings to lease to entities of people’s armed forces, the Minister of National Defense, and Minister of Public Security shall decide on investment after reaching an agreement with the Ministry of Construction;

c) In respect of projects for purchasing commercial housing to lease to local entities, provincial housing authorities shall request Chairpersons of provincial People’s Committees to make investment decision;

d) Primary contents of projects for purchasing commercial housing for use as official housing under this Clause include position, location, type of house, quantity of house, floor area of each type of house, price, relevant costs, fundings for house purchase, payment methods, agencies signing property purchase contracts, project schedule, agencies responsible for housing management after purchase, responsibilities of relevant agencies in project execution;
dd) Purchase price of commercial housing for use as official housing shall be decided by individuals making investment decision on the basis of consulting housing market price and price evaluation results of entities conducting evaluation at the time of purchase.

